<h2>How do I get started?</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Find the original readings and their times in your health app.</li>
  <li>Check which permissions and measurements your stress app uses.</li>
  <li>Look at similar readings over time, with short notes about your routine.</li>
  <li>Keep symptoms and medical decisions separate from a wearable score.</li>
</ol>

<ZenTip image="/app-ui/zen/zen-coffee.webp">
  Jot down <strong>one line a day</strong> about sleep, caffeine or a busy day. It makes your readings easier to understand later.
</ZenTip>

<p>Our <a href="/stress/apple-watch/">Apple Watch stress guide</a>, <a href="/compare/apple-watch-stress-apps/">app comparison</a> and <a href="/resources/stress-sleep-journal/">free observation journal</a> help with those steps.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
